drm/sprd: select DRM_CLIENT_SELECTION

DRM_SPRD calls drm_client_setup() but only got DRM_CLIENT_SELECTION by
accident via DRM_HDLCD/DRM_KOMEDA/DRM_MALI_DISPLAY. Select it directly.

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sprd/Kconfig	2026-10-31 06:12:04.903869149 +0000
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sprd/Kconfig	2026-10-31 06:12:04.904869159 +0000
@@ -3,6 +3,7 @@
 	depends on ARCH_SPRD || COMPILE_TEST
 	depends on DRM && OF
 	select DRM_BRIDGE_CONNECTOR
+	select DRM_CLIENT_SELECTION
 	select DRM_DISPLAY_HELPER
 	select DRM_GEM_DMA_HELPER
 	select DRM_KMS_HELPER
